ator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":1,"chapter_title":"أَذْكَارُ الِاسْتِيقَاظِ مِنَ النَّوْمِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"البخاري مع الفتح 11/ 113 ومسلم 4/ 2083","repetition_count":1}},{"day":1,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 001 · Bukhari 8 · Belief","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا عُبَيْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ مُوسَى، قَالَ أَخْبَرَنَا حَنْظَلَةُ بْنُ أَبِي سُفْيَانَ، عَنْ عِكْرِمَةَ بْنِ خَالِدٍ، عَنِ ابْنِ عُمَرَ ـ رضى الله عنهما ـ قَالَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏ \"‏ بُنِيَ الإِسْلاَمُ عَلَى خَمْسٍ شَهَادَةِ أَنْ لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ اللَّهُ وَأَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا رَسُولُ اللَّهِ، وَإِقَامِ الصَّلاَةِ، وَإِيتَاءِ الزَّكَاةِ، وَالْحَجِّ، وَصَوْمِ رَمَضَانَ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 8; book 2, hadith 1","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/8.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":8,"arabicnumber":8,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:8"}},{"day":2,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 002 · Al-Faatiha 2","original_text":"ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ","translation":"Praise be to Allah, Lord of the Worlds,","reference":"Quran 1:2","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/1:2/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":2,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative 