provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":4,"chapter_title":"الدُّعَاءُ لِمَنْ لَبِسَ ثَوْبًـا جَدِيدًا","entry":1,"source_reference":"ابن ماجه 2/ 1178 والبغوي 12/ 41 وانظر صحيح ابن ماجة 2/ 275","repetition_count":1}},{"day":4,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 004 · Bukhari 6304 · Invocations","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا إِسْمَاعِيلُ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنِي مَالِكٌ، عَنْ أَبِي الزِّنَادِ، عَنِ الأَعْرَجِ، عَنْ أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ، أَنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ لِكُلِّ نَبِيٍّ دَعْوَةٌ مُسْتَجَابَةٌ يَدْعُو بِهَا، وَأُرِيدُ أَنْ أَخْتَبِئَ دَعْوَتِي شَفَاعَةً لأُمَّتِي فِي الآخِرَةِ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6304; book 80, hadith 1","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6304.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6304,"arabicnumber":6304,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6304"}},{"day":5,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 005 · Al-Faatiha 5","original_text":"إِيَّاكَ نَعْبُدُ وَإِيَّاكَ نَسْتَعِينُ","translation":"Thee (alone) we worship; Thee (alone) we ask for help.","reference":"Quran 1:5","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/1:5/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":5,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":5,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 005 · مَا يَقُولُ إِذَا وَضَعَ ثَوْبَهُ","original_text":"بِسْمِ اللَّهِ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 5, entry 1: التّرمذي 2/ 505 وغيره وانظر الإرواء برقم 49 صحيح الجامع 3/ 203","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":5,"chapter_title":"مَا يَقُولُ إِذَا وَضَعَ ثَوْبَهُ","entry":1,"source_reference":"التّرمذي 2/ 505 وغيره وانظر الإرواء برقم 49 صحيح الجامع 3/ 203","repetition_count":1}},{"day":5,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 005 · Bukhari 6412 · To make the Heart Tender (Ar-Riqaq)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا الْمَكِّيُّ بْنُ إِبْرَاهِيمَ، أَخْبَرَنَا عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ سَعِيدٍ ـ هُوَ ابْنُ أَبِي هِنْدٍ ـ عَنْ أَبِيهِ، عَنِ ابْنِ عَبَّاسٍ ـ رضى الله عنهما ـ قَالَ قَالَ النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏ \"‏ نِعْمَتَانِ مَغْبُونٌ فِيهِمَا كَثِيرٌ مِنَ النَّاسِ، الصِّحَّةُ وَالْفَرَاغُ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ عَبَّاسٌ الْعَنْبَرِيُّ حَدَّثَنَا صَفْوَانُ بْنُ عِيسَى، عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ سَعِيدِ بْنِ أَبِي هِنْدٍ، عَنْ أَبِيهِ، سَمِعْتُ ابْنَ عَبَّاسٍ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم مِثْلَهُ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6412; book 81, hadith 1","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6412.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6412,"arabicnumber":6412,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6412"}},{"day":6,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 006 · Al-Faatiha 6","original_text":"ٱهْدِنَا ٱلصِّرَٰطَ ٱلْمُسْتَقِيمَ","translation":"Show us the straight path,","reference":"Quran 1:6","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/1:6/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":6,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 006 · دُعَاءُ دُخُولِ الخَلَاءِ","original_text":"[بِسْمِ اللَّه]، اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنَ الخُبْثِ وَالخَبَائِثِ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 6, entry 1: أخرجه البخاري 1/ 45 ومسلم 1/ 283 وزيادة (بسم الله) في أوله، أخرجها سعيد بن منصور، أنظر فتح الباري 1/ 244","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":6,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ دُخُولِ الخَلَاءِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أخرجه البخاري 1/ 45 ومسلم 1/ 283 وزيادة (بسم الله) في أوله، أخرجها سعيد بن منصور، أنظر فتح الباري 1/ 244","repetition_count":1}},{"day":6,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 006 · Bukhari 7371 · Oneness, Uniqueness of Allah (Tawheed)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو عَاصِمٍ، حَدَّثَنَا زَكَرِيَّاءُ بْنُ إِسْحَاقَ، عَنْ يَحْيَى بْنِ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ صَيْفِيٍّ، عَنْ أَبِي مَعْبَدٍ، عَنِ ابْنِ عَبَّاسٍ، رضى الله عنهما أَنَّ النَّبِيَّ صلى الله عليه وسلم بَعَثَ مُعَاذًا إِلَى الْيَمَنِ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 7371; book 97, hadith 1","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/7371.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":7371,"arabicnumber":7371,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:7371"}},{"day":7,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 007 · Al-Faatiha 7","original_text":"صِرَٰطَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَنْعَمْتَ عَلَيْهِمْ غَيْرِ ٱلْمَغْضُوبِ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","translation":"The path of those whom Thou hast favoured; Not the (path) of those who earn Thine 