"title":"Day 009 · الذِّكْرُ عِنْدَ الخُرُوجِ مِنَ الـمَنْزِلِ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَعُوذُ بِكَ أَنْ أَضِلَّ أَوْ أُضَلَّ أَوْ أَزِلَّ، أو أُزَلَّ، أَوْ أَظْلِم أَوْ أُظْلَمَ، أَوْ أَجْهَلَ أَوْ يُجْهَلَ عَلَيَّ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 10, entry 1: أهل السنن وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 3/ 152 وصحيح ابن ماجه 2/ 336","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":10,"chapter_title":"الذِّكْرُ عِنْدَ الخُرُوجِ مِنَ الـمَنْزِلِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أهل السنن وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 3/ 152 وصحيح ابن ماجه 2/ 336","repetition_count":1}},{"day":9,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 009 · Bukhari 61 · Knowledge","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا قُتَيْبَةُ، حَدَّثَنَا إِسْمَاعِيلُ بْنُ جَعْفَرٍ، عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ دِينَارٍ، عَنِ ابْنِ عُمَرَ، قَالَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏\"‏ إِنَّ مِنَ الشَّجَرِ شَجَرَةً لاَ يَسْقُطُ وَرَقُهَا، وَإِنَّهَا مَثَلُ الْمُسْلِمِ، فَحَدِّثُونِي مَا هِيَ ‏\"‏‏.‏ فَوَقَعَ النَّاسُ فِي شَجَرِ الْبَوَادِي‏.‏ قَالَ عَبْدُ اللَّهِ وَوَقَعَ فِي نَفْسِي أَنَّهَا النَّخْلَةُ، فَاسْتَحْيَيْتُ ثُمَّ قَالُوا حَدِّثْنَا مَا هِيَ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ قَالَ ‏\"‏ هِيَ النَّخْلَةُ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 61; book 3, hadith 3","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/61.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":61,"arabicnumber":61,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:61"}},{"day":10,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 010 · An-Naas 3","original_text":"إِلَٰهِ ٱلنَّاسِ","translation":"The god of mankind,","reference":"Quran 114:3","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/114:3/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6233,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":10,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 010 · الذِّكْرُ عِنْدَ دُخُولِ الـمَنْزِلِ","original_text":"بِسْمِ اللًّهِ وَلَجْنَا، وَبِسْمِ اللَّهِ خَرَجْنَا، وَعَلَى اللَّهِ رَبِّنَا تَوَكَّلْنَا. ثُمَّ لِيُسَلِّمْ عَلَى أَهْلِهِ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 11, entry 1: أخرجه أبو داود 4/ 325، وحسن إسناده العلامة ابن باز في تحفة الأخيار ص 28، وفي الصحيح (إذا دخل الرجل بيته فذكر بيته فذكر الله عند دخوله وعند طعامه قال الشيطان لا مبيت لكم ولا عشاء) مسلم برقم 2018","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":11,"chapter_title":"الذِّكْرُ عِنْدَ دُخُولِ الـمَنْزِلِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أخرجه أبو داود 4/ 325، وحسن إسناده العلامة ابن باز في تحفة الأخيار ص 28، وفي الصحيح (إذا دخل الرجل بيته فذكر بيته فذكر الله عند دخوله وعند طعامه قال الشيطان لا مبيت لكم ولا عشاء) مسلم برقم 2018","repetition_count":1}},{"day":10,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 010 · Bukhari 5971 · Good Manners and Form (Al-Adab)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا قُتَيْبَةُ بْنُ سَعِيدٍ، حَدَّثَنَا جَرِيرٌ، عَنْ عُمَارَةَ بْنِ الْقَعْقَاعِ بْنِ شُبْرُمَةَ، عَنْ أَبِي زُرْعَةَ، عَنْ أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ قَالَ جَاءَ رَجُلٌ إِلَى رَسُولِ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم فَقَالَ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ مَنْ أَحَقُّ بِحُسْنِ صَحَابَتِي قَالَ ‏\"‏ أُمُّكَ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ ثُمَّ مَنْ قَالَ ‏\"‏ أُمُّكَ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ ثُمَّ مَنْ قَالَ ‏\"‏ أُمُّكَ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ ثُمَّ مَنْ قَالَ ‏\"‏ ثُمَّ أَبُوكَ ‏\"‏‏.‏ وَقَالَ ابْنُ شُبْرُمَةَ وَيَحْيَى بْنُ أَيُّوبَ حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو زُرْعَةَ مِثْلَهُ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 5971; book 78, hadith 2","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/5971.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":5971,"arabicnumber":5971,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:5971"}},{"day":11,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 011 · An-Naas 4","original_text":"مِن شَرِّ ٱلْوَسْوَاسِ ٱلْخَنَّاسِ","translation":"From the evil of the sneaking whisperer,","reference":"Quran 114:4","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/114:4/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6234,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":11,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 011 · دُعَاءُ الذَّهَابِ إِلَى الـمَسْجِدِ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ اجْعَلْ فِي قَلْبِي نُورًا، وَفِي لِسَانِي نُورًا، وَفِي سَمْعِي نُورًا، وَفِي بَصَرِي نُورًا، وَمِنْ فَوْقِي نُورًا، وَمِنْ تَحْتِي نُورًا، وَعَنْ يَمِينِي نُورًا، وَعَنْ شِمَالِي نُورا، وَمِنْ أَمَامِي نُورًا، وَمِنْ خَلْفِي نُورًا، وَاجْعَلْ فِي نَفْسِي نُورًا، وَأَعْظِمْ لِي نُورًا، وَعَظِّمْ لِي نُورًا، وَاجْعَلْ لِي نُورًا، وَاجْعَلْنِي نُورًا. اللَّهُمَّ أَعْطِنِي نُورًا، وَاجْعَلْ فِي عَصَبِي نُورًا، وَفِي لَحْمِي نُورًا، وَفِي دَمِي نُورًا، وَفِي شَعْرِي نُورًا، وَفِي بَشَرِي نُورًا","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 12, entry 1: جميع هذه الخصال في البخاري 11/ 116 برقم 6316 ومسلم 1/ 526، 529، 530 برقم 763","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":12,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الذَّهَابِ إِلَى الـمَسْجِدِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"جميع هذه الخصال في البخاري 11/ 116 برقم 6316 ومسلم 1/ 526، 529، 530 برقم 763","repetition_count":1}},{"day":11,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 011 · Bukhari 6305 · Invocations","original_text":"وَقَالَ لِي خَلِيفَةُ قَالَ مُعْتَمِرٌ سَمِعْتُ أَبِي، عَنْ أَنَسٍ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ كُلُّ نَبِيٍّ سَأَلَ سُؤْلاً ـ أَوْ قَالَ لِكُلِّ نَبِيٍّ دَعْوَةٌ قَدْ دَعَا بِهَا ـ فَاسْتُجِيبَ، فَجَعَلْتُ دَعْوَتِي شَفَاعَةً لأُمَّتِي يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6305; book 80, hadith 2","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6305.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6305,"arabicnumber":6305,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6305"}},{"day":12,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 012 · An-Naas 5","original_text":"ٱلَّذِى يُوَسْوِسُ فِى صُدُورِ ٱلنَّاسِ","translation":"Who whispereth in the hearts of mankind,","reference":"Quran 114:5","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/114:5/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6235,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":12,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 012 · دُعَاءُ دُخُولِ الـمَسْجِدِ","original_text":"أَعُوذُ بِاللَّهِ العَظِيمِ، وَبِوَجْهِهِ الكَرِيمِ، وَسُلْطَانِهِ القَدِيمِ، مِنَ الشَّيْطَانِ الرَّجِيمِ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 13, entry 1: أبو داود وانظر صحيح الجامع برقم 4591","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":13,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ دُخُولِ الـمَسْجِدِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أبو داود وانظر صحيح الجامع برقم 4591","repetition_count":1}},{"day":12,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 012 · Bukhari 6413 · To make the Heart Tender (Ar-Riqaq)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ بَشَّارٍ، حَدَّثَنَا غُنْدَرٌ، حَدَّثَنَا شُعْبَةُ، عَنْ مُعَاوِيَةَ بْنِ قُرَّةَ، عَنْ أَنَسٍ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ اللَّهُمَّ لاَ عَيْشَ إِلاَّ عَيْشُ الآخِرَة، فَأَصْلِحِ الأَنْصَارَ وَالْمُهَاجِرَة ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6413; book 81, hadith 2","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6413.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6413,"arabicnumber":6413,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6413"}},{"day":13,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 013 · An-Naas 6","original_text":"مِنَ ٱلْجِنَّةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ","translation":"Of the jinn and of mankind.","reference":"Quran 114:6","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/114:6/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6236,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":13,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 013 · دُعَاءُ الخُرُوجِ مِنَ الـمَسْجِدِ","original_text":"بِسْمِ اللَّهِ وَالصَّلَاةُ وَالسَّلَامُ عَلَى رَسُولِ اللَّهِ، اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ مِنْ فَضْلِكَ، اللَّهُمَّ اعْصِمْنِي مِنَ الشَّيْطَانِ الرَّجِيمِ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 14, entry 1: انظر تخريج روايات الحديث السابق رقم 20 وزيادة (اللهم اعصمني من الشيطان الرجيم) لابن ماجه. انظر صحيح ابن ماجه 1/ 129","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":14,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الخُرُوجِ مِنَ الـمَسْجِدِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"انظر تخريج روايات الحديث السابق رقم 20 وزيادة (اللهم اعصمني من الشيطان الرجيم) لابن ماجه. انظر صحيح ابن ماجه 1/ 129","repetition_count":1}},{"day":13,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 013 · Bukhari 7373 · Oneness, Uniqueness of Allah (Tawheed)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ بَشَّارٍ، حَدَّثَنَا غُنْدَرٌ، حَدَّثَنَا شُعْبَةُ، عَنْ أَبِي حَصِينٍ، وَالأَشْعَثِ بْنِ سُلَيْمٍ، سَمِعَا الأَسْوَدَ بْنَ هِلاَلٍ، عَنْ مُعَاذِ بْنِ جَبَلٍ، قَالَ قَالَ النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏\"‏ يَا مُعَاذُ أَتَدْرِي مَا حَقُّ اللَّهِ عَلَى الْعِبَادِ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ اللَّهُ وَرَسُولُهُ أَعْلَمُ‏.‏ قَالَ ‏\"‏ أَنْ يَعْبُدُوهُ وَلاَ يُشْرِكُوا بِهِ شَيْئًا، أَتَدْرِي مَا حَقُّهُمْ عَلَيْهِ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ اللَّهُ وَرَسُولُهُ أَعْلَمُ‏.‏ قَالَ ‏\"‏ أَنْ لاَ يُعَذِّبَهُمْ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 7373; book 97, hadith 3","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/7373.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":7373,"arabicnumber":7373,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:7373"}},{"day":14,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 014 · Al-Falaq 1","origi