َّعْبِيِّ، عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ عَمْرٍو ـ رضى الله عنهما ـ عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ الْمُسْلِمُ مَنْ سَلِمَ الْمُسْلِمُونَ مِنْ لِسَانِهِ وَيَدِهِ، وَالْمُهَاجِرُ مَنْ هَجَرَ مَا نَهَى اللَّهُ عَنْهُ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ أَبُو عَبْدِ اللَّهِ وَقَالَ أَبُو مُعَاوِيَةَ حَدَّثَنَا دَاوُدُ عَنْ عَامِرٍ قَالَ سَمِعْتُ عَبْدَ اللَّهِ عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم‏.‏ وَقَالَ عَبْدُ الأَعْلَى عَنْ دَاوُدَ عَنْ عَامِرٍ عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 10; book 2, hadith 3","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/10.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":10,"arabicnumber":10,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:10"}},{"day":16,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 016 · Al-Falaq 3","original_text":"وَمِن شَرِّ غَاسِقٍ إِذَا وَقَبَ","translation":"From the evil of the darkness when it is intense,","reference":"Quran 113:3","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/113:3/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6228,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":16,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 016 · دُعَاءُ الرُّكُوعِ","original_text":"سُبْحَانَ رَبِّيَ العَظِيمِ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 17, entry 1: أخرجه أهل السنن وأحمد وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 1/ 83","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":17,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الرُّكُوعِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أخرجه أهل السنن وأحمد وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 1/ 83","repetition_count":3}},{"day":16,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 016 · Bukhari 62 · Knowledge","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا خَالِدُ بْنُ مَخْلَدٍ، حَدَّثَنَا سُلَيْمَانُ، حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ دِينَارٍ، عَنِ ابْنِ عُمَرَ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏\"‏ إِنَّ مِنَ الشَّجَرِ شَجَرَةً لاَ يَسْقُطُ وَرَقُهَا، وَإِنَّهَا مَثَلُ الْمُسْلِمِ، حَدِّثُونِي مَا هِيَ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ فَوَقَعَ النَّاسُ فِي شَجَرِ الْبَوَادِي‏.‏ قَالَ عَبْدُ اللَّهِ فَوَقَعَ فِي نَفْسِي أَنَّهَا النَّخْلَةُ، ثُمَّ قَالُوا حَدِّثْنَا مَا هِيَ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ قَالَ ‏\"‏ هِيَ النَّخْلَةُ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 62; book 3, hadith 4","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/62.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawa