ob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":18,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الرَّفْعِ مِنَ الرُّكُوعِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"البخاري مع الفتح 2/ 282","repetition_count":1}},{"day":17,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 017 · Bukhari 5972 · Good Manners and Form (Al-Adab)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُسَدَّدٌ، حَدَّثَنَا يَحْيَى، عَنْ سُفْيَانَ، وَشُعْبَةَ، قَالاَ حَدَّثَنَا حَبِيبٌ، ح قَالَ وَحَدَّثَنَا مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ كَثِيرٍ، أَخْبَرَنَا سُفْيَانُ، عَنْ حَبِيبٍ، عَنْ أَبِي الْعَبَّاسِ، عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ عَمْرٍو، قَالَ قَالَ رَجُلٌ لِلنَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم أُجَاهِدُ‏.‏ قَالَ ‏\"‏ لَكَ أَبَوَانِ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ نَعَمْ‏.‏ قَالَ ‏\"‏ فَفِيهِمَا فَجَاهِدْ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 5972; book 78, hadith 3","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/5972.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":5972,"arabicnumber":5972,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:5972"}},{"day":18,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 018 · Al-Falaq 5","original_text":"وَمِن شَرِّ حَاسِدٍ إِذَا حَسَدَ","translation":"And from the evil of the envier when he envieth.","reference":"Quran 113:5","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/113:5/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6230,"license_notice":"