 9","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/7379.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":7379,"arabicnumber":7379,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:7379"}},{"day":39,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 039 · Al-Kawthar 3","original_text":"إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ ٱلْأَبْتَرُ","translation":"Lo! it is thy insulter (and not thou) who is without posterity.","reference":"Quran 108:3","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/108:3/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6207,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":39,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 039 · دُعَاءُ مَنْ أَصَابَهُ شَكٌّ فِي الِإيمَانِ","original_text":"يَسْتَعِيذُ بِاللَّهِ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 41, entry 1: البخاري مع الفتح 6/ 336 ومسلم 1/ 120","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":41,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ مَنْ أَصَابَهُ شَكٌّ فِي الِإيمَانِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"البخاري مع الفتح 6/ 336 ومسلم 1/ 120","repetition_count":1}},{"day":39,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 039 · Bukhari 14 · Belief","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو الْيَمَانِ، قَالَ أَخْبَرَنَا شُعَيْبٌ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو الزِّنَادِ، عَنِ الأَعْرَجِ، عَنْ أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ أَنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ فَوَالَّذِي نَفْسِي بِيَدِهِ لاَ يُؤْمِنُ أَحَدُكُمْ حَتَّى أَكُونَ أَحَبَّ إِلَيْهِ مِنْ وَالِدِهِ وَوَلَدِهِ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 14; book 2, hadith 7","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/14.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":14,"arabicnumber":14,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:14"}},{"day":40,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 040 · Al-Maa'un 1","original_text":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ","translation":"Hast thou observed him who belieth religion?","reference":"Quran 107:1","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/107:1/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":