شُعْبَةُ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنِي أَبُو التَّيَّاحِ، عَنْ أَنَسٍ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ يَسِّرُوا وَلاَ تُعَسِّرُوا، وَبَشِّرُوا وَلاَ تُنَفِّرُوا ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 69; book 3, hadith 11","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/69.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":69,"arabicnumber":69,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:69"}},{"day":41,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 041 · Al-Maa'un 2","original_text":"فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِى يَدُعُّ ٱلْيَتِيمَ","translation":"That is he who repelleth the orphan,","reference":"Quran 107:2","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/107:2/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6199,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":41,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 041 · دُعَاءُ الوَسْوَسَةِ فِي الصَّلَاةِ وَالقِرَاءَةِ","original_text":"يَقُولُ: (أَعُوذُ بِاللَّهِ مِنَ الشَّيْطَانِ الرَّجِيمِ)، وَيَتْفُلْ عَلَى يَسَارِهِ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 43, entry 1: مسلم 4/ 1729 من حديث عثمان بن أبي العاص رضي اللّه عنه، وفيه: ففعلت ذلك فأذهبه اللّه عنّي","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":43,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الوَسْوَسَةِ فِي الصَّلَاةِ وَالقِرَاءَةِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"مسلم 4/ 1729 من حديث عثمان بن أبي العاص رضي اللّه عنه، وفيه: ففعلت ذلك فأذهبه اللّه عنّي","repetition_count":3}},{"day":41,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 041 · Bukhari 5977 · Good Manners and Form (Al-Adab)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنِي مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ الْوَلِيدِ، حَدَّثَنَا مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ جَعْفَرٍ، حَدَّثَنَا شُعْبَةُ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنِي عُبَيْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ أَبِي بَكْرٍ، قَالَ سَمِعْتُ أَنَسَ بْنَ مَالِكٍ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ قَالَ ذَكَرَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم الْكَبَائِرَ، أَوْ سُئِلَ عَنِ الْكَبَائِرِ فَقَالَ ‏\"‏ الشِّرْكُ بِاللَّهِ، وَقَتْلُ النَّفْسِ، وَعُقُوقُ الْوَالِدَيْنِ ‏\"‏‏.‏ فَقَالَ ‏\"‏ أَلاَ أُنَبِّئُكُمْ بِأَكْبَرِ الْكَبَائِرِ ـ قَالَ ـ قَوْلُ الزُّورِ ـ أَوْ قَالَ ـ شَهَادَةُ الزُّورِ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ شُعْبَةُ وَأَكْثَرُ ظَنِّي أَنَّهُ قَالَ ‏\"‏ شَهَادَةُ الزُّورِ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 5977; book 78, hadith 8","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/5977.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":5977,"arabicnumber":5977,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:5977"}},{"day":42,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 042 · Al-Maa'un 3","original_text":"وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ","translation":"And urgeth not the feeding of the needy.","reference":"Quran 107:3","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/107:3/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6200,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":42,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 042 · دُعاءُ مَنِ اسْتَصْعَبَ عَلَيْهِ أَمْرٌ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ لَا سَهْلَ إِلَّا مَا جَعَلْتَهُ سَهْلًا وَأَنْتَ تَجْعَلُ الحَزْنَ إِذَا شِئْتَ سَهْلًا","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 44, entry 1: رواه ابن حبان في صحيحه برقم 2427 (موارد) وابن السّنّي برقم 351 وقال الحافظ: هذا حديث صحيح، وصحّحه عبدالقادر الأرناؤوط في تخريج الأذكار للنّووي ص 106","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":44,"chapter_title":"دُعاءُ مَنِ اسْتَصْعَبَ عَلَيْهِ أَمْرٌ","entry":1,"source_reference":"رواه ابن حبان في صحيحه برقم 2427 (موارد) وابن السّنّي برقم 351 وقال الحافظ: هذا حديث صحيح، وصحّحه عبدالقادر الأرناؤوط في تخريج الأذكار للنّووي ص 106","repetition_count":1}},{"day":42,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 042 · Bukhari 6314 · Invocations","original_text":"حَدَّثَنِي مُوسَى بْنُ إِسْمَاعِيلَ، حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو عَوَانَةَ، عَنْ عَبْدِ الْمَلِكِ، عَنْ رِبْعِيٍّ، عَنْ حُذَيْفَةَ ـ رضى الله عنه قَالَ كَانَ النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم إِذَا أَخَذَ مَضْجَعَهُ مِنَ اللَّيْلِ وَضَعَ يَدَهُ تَحْتَ خَدِّهِ ثُمَّ يَقُولُ ‏\"‏ اللَّهُمَّ بِاسْمِكَ أَمُوتُ وَأَحْيَا ‏\"‏‏.‏ وَإِذَا اسْتَيْقَظَ قَالَ ‏\"‏ الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ الَّذِي أَحْيَانَا بَعْدَ مَا أَمَاتَنَا وَإِلَيْهِ النُّشُورُ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6314; book 80, hadith 11","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6314.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6314,"arabicnumber":6314,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6314"}},{"day":43,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 043 · Al-Maa'un 4","original_text":"فَوَيْلٌۭ لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ","translation":"Ah, woe unto worshippers","reference":"Quran 107:4","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/107:4/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","