json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":62,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الرِّيحِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أخرجه أبو داود 4/ 326 وابن ماجة 2/ 1228 وانظر صحيح ابن ماجة 2/ 305","repetition_count":1}},{"day":60,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 060 · Bukhari 6322 · Invocations","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ عَرْعَرَةَ، حَدَّثَنَا شُعْبَةُ، عَنْ عَبْدِ الْعَزِيزِ بْنِ صُهَيْبٍ، عَنْ أَنَسِ بْنِ مَالِكٍ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ قَالَ كَانَ النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم إِذَا دَخَلَ الْخَلاَءَ قَالَ ‏ \"‏ اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنَ الْخُبُثِ وَالْخَبَائِثِ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6322; book 80, hadith 19","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6322.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6322,"arabicnumber":6322,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6322"}},{"day":61,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 061 · Al-Humaza 6","original_text":"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْمُوقَدَةُ","translation":"(It is) the fire of Allah, kindled,","reference":"Quran 104:6","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/104:6/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6185,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":61,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 061 · دُعَاءُ الرَّعْدِ","original_text":"سُبْحَانَ الذِي يُسَبِّحُ الرَّعْدُ بِحَمْدِهِ وَالمَلَائِكَةُ مِنْ خِيفَتِهِ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 63, entry 1: كان عبداللّه بن الزّبير رضي اللّه عنهما إذا سَمِعَ الرّعد ترك الحديث وقال: '...'، الموطّأ 2/ 992 وقال الألبانيّ: صحيح الإسناد موقوفا","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":63,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الرَّعْدِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"كان عبداللّه بن الزّبير رضي اللّه عنهما إذا سَمِعَ الرّعد ترك الحديث وقال: '...'، الموطّأ 2/ 992 وقال الألبانيّ: صحيح الإسناد موقوفا","repetition_count":1}},{"day":61,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 061 · Bukhari 6421 · To make the Heart Tender (Ar-Riqaq)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُسْلِمُ بْنُ إِبْرَاهِيمَ، حَدَّثَنَا هِشَامٌ، حَدَّثَنَا قَتَادَةُ، عَنْ أَنَسٍ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ قَالَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏ \"‏ يَكْبَرُ ابْنُ آدَمَ وَيَكْبَرُ مَعَهُ اثْنَانِ حُبُّ الْمَالِ، وَطُولُ الْعُمُرِ ‏\"‏‏.‏ رَوَاهُ شُعْبَةُ عَنْ قَتَادَةَ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6421; book 81, hadith 10","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6421.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6421,"arabicnumber":6421,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6421"}},{"day":62,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 062 · Al-Humaza 7","original_text":"ٱلَّتِى تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةِ","translation":"Which leapeth up over the hearts (of men).","reference":"Quran 104:7","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/104:7/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6186,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":62,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 062 · مِنْ أَدْعِيَةِ الاسْتِسْقَاءِ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ اَسْقِنَا غَيْثًا مُغِيثًا مَرِيئًا مَرِيعًا، نَافِعًا غَيْرَ ضَارٍّ، عَاجِلًا غَيْرَ آجِلٍ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 64, entry 1: أبو داود 1/ 303 وصحّحه الألباني في صحيح أبي داود 1/ 216","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":64,"chapter_title":"مِنْ أَدْعِيَةِ الاسْتِسْقَاءِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أبو داود 1/ 303 وصحّحه الألباني في صحيح أبي داود 1/ 216","repetition_count":1}},{"day":62,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 062 · Bukhari 7383 · Oneness, Uniqueness of Allah (Tawheed)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو مَعْمَرٍ، حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدُ الْوَارِثِ، حَدَّثَنَا حُسَيْنٌ الْمُعَلِّمُ، حَدَّثَنِي عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ بُرَيْدَةَ، عَنْ يَحْيَى بْنِ يَعْمَرَ، عَنِ ابْنِ عَبَّاسٍ، أَنَّ النَّبِيَّ صلى الله عليه وسلم كَانَ يَقُولُ ‏ \"‏ أَعُوذُ بِعِزَّتِكَ الَّذِي لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ أَنْتَ، الَّذِي لاَ يَمُوتُ وَالْجِنُّ وَالإِنْسُ يَمُوتُونَ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 7383; book 97, hadith 13","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/7383.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":7383,"arabicnumber":7383,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:7383"}},{"day":63,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 063 · Al-Humaza 8","original_text":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِم مُّؤْصَدَةٌۭ","translation":"Lo! it is closed in on them","reference":"Quran 104:8","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ay