hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":67,"chapter_title":"مِنْ أَدْعِيَةِ الاسْتِصْحَاءِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"البخاري 1/ 224 ومسلم 2/ 614","repetition_count":1}},{"day":65,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 065 · Bukhari 5982 · Good Manners and Form (Al-Adab)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو الْوَلِيدِ، حَدَّثَنَا شُعْبَةُ، قَالَ أَخْبَرَنِي ابْنُ عُثْمَانَ، قَالَ سَمِعْتُ مُوسَى بْنَ طَلْحَةَ، عَنْ أَبِي أَيُّوبَ، قَالَ قِيلَ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ، أَخْبِرْنِي بِعَمَلٍ، يُدْخِلُنِي الْجَنَّةَ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 5982; book 78, hadith 13","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/5982.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":5982,"arabicnumber":5982,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:5982"}},{"day":66,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 066 · Al-Asr 2","original_text":"إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لَفِى خُسْرٍ","translation":"Lo! man is a state of loss,","reference":"Quran 103:2","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/103:2/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6178,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":66,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 066 · دُعَاءُ رُؤْيَةِ الهِلَالِ","original_text":"اللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ. اللَّهُمَّ أَهِلَّهُ عَلَيْنَا بِالأَمْنِ وَالإِيمَانِ، وَالسَّلَامَةِ وَالإِسْلَامِ، وَالتَّوْفِيقِ لِمَا تُحِبُّ رَبَّنَا وَتَرْضَى. رَبُّنَا وَرَبُّكَ اللَّهُ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 68, entry 1: التّرمذي 5/ 504 والدّارمي بلفظه 1/ 336 وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 3/ 157","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":68,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ رُؤْيَةِ الهِلَالِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"التّرمذي 5/ 504 والدّارمي بلفظه 1/ 336 وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 3/ 157","repetition_count":1}},{"day":66,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 066 · Bukhari 6323 · Invocations","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُسَدَّدٌ، حَدَّثَنَا يَزِيدُ بْنُ زُرَيْعٍ، حَدَّثَنَا حُسَيْنٌ، حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ بُرَيْدَةَ، عَنْ بُشَيْرِ بْنِ كَعْبٍ، عَنْ شَدَّادِ بْنِ أَوْسٍ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ سَيِّدُ الاِسْتِغْفَارِ اللَّهُمَّ أَنْتَ رَبِّي لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ أَنْتَ، خَلَقْتَنِي وَأَنَا عَبْدُكَ، وَأَنَا عَلَى عَهْدِكَ وَوَعْدِكَ مَا اسْتَطَعْتُ، أَبُوءُ لَكَ بِنِعْمَتِكَ، وَأَبُوءُ لَكَ بِذَنْبِي، فَاغْفِرْ لِي، فَإِنَّهُ لاَ يَغْفِرُ الذُّنُوبَ إِلاَّ أَنْتَ، أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ مَا صَنَعْتُ‏.‏ إِذَا قَالَ حِينَ يُمْسِي فَمَاتَ دَخَلَ الْجَنَّةَ ـ أَوْ كَانَ مِنْ أَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ ـ وَإِذَا قَالَ حِينَ يُصْبِحُ فَمَاتَ مِنْ يَوْمِهِ ‏\"‏‏.‏ مِثْلَهُ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6323; book 80, hadith 20","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6323.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6323,"arabicnumber":6323,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6323"}},{"day":67,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 067 · Al-Asr 3","original_text":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ وَتَوَاصَوْا۟ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَتَوَاصَوْا۟ بِٱلصَّبْرِ","translation":"Save those who believe and do good works, and exhort one another to truth and exhort one another to endurance.","reference":"Quran 103:3","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/103:3/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6179,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":67,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 067 · الدُّعَاءُ عِنْدَ إِفْطَارِ الصَّائِمِ","original_text":"ذَهَبَ الظَّمَأُ وَابْتَلَّتِ العُرُوقُ، وَثَبَتَ الأَجْرُ إِنْ شَاءَ اللَّهُ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 69, entry 1: أخرجه أبو داود 2/ 306 وغيره، وانظر صحيح الجامع 4/ 209","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":69,"chapter_title":"الدُّعَاءُ عِنْدَ إِفْطَارِ الصَّائِمِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أخرجه أبو داود 2/ 306 وغيره، وانظر صحيح الجامع 4/ 209","repetition_count":1}},{"day":67,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 067 · Bukhari 6422 · To make the Heart Tender (Ar-Riqaq)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُعَاذُ بْنُ أَسَدٍ، أَخْبَرَنَا عَبْدُ اللَّهِ، أَخْبَرَنَا مَعْمَرٌ، عَنِ الزُّهْرِيِّ، قَالَ أَخْبَرَنِي مَحْمُودُ بْنُ الرَّبِيعِ، وَزَعَمَ، مَحْمُودٌ أَنَّهُ عَقَلَ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم وَقَالَ وَعَقَلَ مَجَّةً مَجَّهَا مِنْ دَلْوٍ كَانَتْ فِي دَارِهِمْ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6422; book 81, hadith 11","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6422.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c