cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":73,"chapter_title":"الدُّعَاءُ لِمَنْ سَقَاهُ أَوْ إِذَا أَرَادَ ذَلِكَ","entry":1,"source_reference":"مسلم 3/ 126","repetition_count":1}},{"day":71,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 071 · Bukhari 5983 · Good Manners and Form (Al-Adab)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنِي عَبْدُ الرَّحْمَنِ، حَدَّثَنَا بَهْزٌ، حَدَّثَنَا شُعْبَةُ، حَدَّثَنَا ابْنُ عُثْمَانَ بْنِ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ مَوْهَبٍ، وَأَبُوهُ، عُثْمَانُ بْنُ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ أَنَّهُمَا سَمِعَا مُوسَى بْنَ طَلْحَةَ، عَنْ أَبِي أَيُّوبَ الأَنْصَارِيِّ ـ رضى الله عنه أَنَّ رَجُلاً قَالَ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ أَخْبِرْنِي بِعَمَلٍ يُدْخِلُنِي الْجَنَّةَ‏.‏ فَقَالَ الْقَوْمُ مَالَهُ مَالَهُ فَقَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏\"‏ أَرَبٌ مَالَهُ ‏\"‏‏.‏ فَقَالَ النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏\"‏ تَعْبُدُ اللَّهَ لاَ تُشْرِكُ بِهِ شَيْئًا، وَتُقِيمُ الصَّلاَةَ، وَتُؤْتِي الزَّكَاةَ، وَتَصِلُ الرَّحِمَ، ذَرْهَا ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ كَأَنَّهُ كَانَ عَلَى رَاحِلَتِهِ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 5983; book 78, hadith 14","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/5983.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":5983,"arabicnumber":5983,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:5983"}},{"day":72,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 072 · At-Takaathur 5","original_text":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","translation":"Nay, would that ye knew (now) with a sure knowledge!","reference":"Quran 102:5","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/102:5/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6173,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":72,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 072 · الدُّعَاءُ إِذَا أَفْطَرَ عِنْدَ أَهْلِ بَيْتٍ","original_text":"أَفْطَرَ عِنْدَكُمُ الصَّائِمُونَ، وَأَكَلَ طَعَامَكُمُ الأَبْرَارُ، وَصَلَّتْ عَلَيْكُمُ المَلَائِكَةُ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 74, entry 1: سنن أبي داود 3/ 367، وابن ماجة 1/ 556، والنّسائي في عمل اليوم واللّيلة برقم: 296 - 298، ونصّ على أنّه صلّى اللّه عليه وسلّم يقوله إذا أفطر عند أهل بيت، وصحّحه الألباني في صحيح أبي داود 2/ 730","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":74,"chapter_title":"الدُّعَاءُ إِذَا أَفْطَرَ عِنْدَ أَهْلِ بَيْتٍ","entry":1,"source_reference":"سنن أبي داود 3/ 367، وابن ماجة 1/ 556، والنّسائي في عمل اليوم واللّيلة برقم: 296 - 298، ونصّ على أنّه صلّى اللّه عليه وسلّم يقوله إذا أفطر عند أهل بيت، وصحّحه الألباني في صحيح أبي داود 2/ 730","repetition_count":1}},{"day":72,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 072 · Bukhari 6324 · Invocations","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو نُعَيْمٍ، حَدَّثَنَا سُفْيَانُ، عَنْ عَبْدِ الْمَلِكِ بْنِ عُمَيْرٍ، عَنْ رِبْعِيِّ بْنِ حِرَاشٍ، عَنْ حُذَيْفَةَ، قَالَ كَانَ النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم إِذَا أَرَادَ أَنْ يَنَامَ قَالَ ‏\"‏ بِاسْمِكَ اللَّهُمَّ أَمُوتُ وَأَحْيَا ‏\"‏‏.‏ وَإِذَا اسْتَيْقَظَ مِنْ مَنَامِهِ قَالَ ‏\"‏ الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ الَّذِي أَحْيَانَا بَعْدَ مَا أَمَاتَنَا، وَإِلَيْهِ النُّشُورُ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6324; book 80, hadith 21","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6324.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6324,"arabicnumber":6324,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6324"}},{"day":73,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 073 · At-Takaathur 6","original_text":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ","translation":"For ye will behold hell-fire.","reference":"Quran 102:6","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/102:6/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6174,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":73,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 073 · دُعَاءُ الصَّائِمِ إِذَا حَضَرَ الطَّعَامُ وَلَمْ يُفْطِرْ","original_text":"(إِذَا دُعِيَ أَحَدُكُمْ فَلْيُجِبْ، فَإِنْ كَانَ صَائِمًا فَلْيُصَلِّ وَإِنْ كَانَ مُفْطِرًا فَلْيَطْعَمْ).\r\nوَمَعْنَى فَلْيُصَلِّ أَيْ: فَلْيَدْعُ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 75, entry 1: مسلم 2/ 1054","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":75,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الصَّائِمِ إِذَا حَضَرَ الطَّعَامُ وَلَمْ يُفْطِرْ","entry":1,"source_reference":"مسلم 2/ 1054","repetition_count":1}},{"day":73,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 073 · Bukhari 6423 · To make the Heart Tender (Ar-Riqaq)","original_text":"قَالَ سَمِعْتُ عِتْبَانَ بْنَ مَالِكٍ الأَنْصَارِيَّ، ثُمَّ أَحَدَ بَنِي سَالِمٍ قَالَ غَدَا عَلَىَّ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم فَقَالَ ‏ \"‏ لَنْ يُوَافِيَ عَبْدٌ يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ يَقُولُ لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ اللَّهُ‏.‏ يَبْتَغِي بِهِ وَجْهَ اللَّهِ، إِلاَّ حَرَّمَ اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ النَّارَ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6423; book 81, hadith 12","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6423.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6423,"arabicnumber":6423,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6423"}},{"day":74,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 074 · At-Takaathur 7","original_text":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","translation":"Aye, ye will behold it with sure vision.","reference":"Quran 102:7","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/102:7/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6175,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":74,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 074 · مَا يَقُولُ الصَّائِمُ إِذَا سَابَّهُ أَحَدٌ","original_text":"إِنِّي صَائِمٌ، إِنِّي صَائِمٌ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 76, entry 1: البخاري مع الفتح 4/ 103، ومسلم 2/ 806","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":76,"chapter_title":"مَا يَقُولُ الصَّائِمُ إِذَا سَابَّهُ أَحَدٌ","entry":1,"source_reference":"البخاري مع الفتح 4/ 103، ومسلم 2/ 806","repetition_count":1}},{"day":74,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 074 · Bukhari 7386 · Oneness, Uniqueness of Allah (Tawheed)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا سُلَيْمَانُ بْنُ حَرْبٍ، حَدَّثَنَا حَمَّادُ بْنُ زَيْدٍ، عَنْ أَيُّوبَ، عَنْ أَبِي عُثْمَانَ، عَنْ أَبِي مُوسَى، قَالَ كُنَّا مَعَ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم فِي سَفَرٍ فَكُنَّا إِذَا عَلَوْنَا كَبَّرْنَا فَقَالَ ‏\"‏ ارْبَعُوا عَلَى أَنْفُسِكُمْ، فَإِنَّكُمْ لاَ تَدْعُونَ أَصَمَّ وَلاَ غَائِبًا، تَدْعُونَ سَمِيعًا بَصِيرًا قَرِيبًا ‏\"‏‏.‏ ثُمَّ أَتَى عَلَىَّ وَأَنَا أَقُولُ فِي نَفْسِي لاَ حَوْلَ وَلاَ قُوَّةَ إِلاَّ بِاللَّهِ‏.‏ فَقَالَ لِي ‏\"‏ يَا عَبْدَ اللَّهِ بْنَ قَيْسٍ قُلْ لاَ حَوْلَ وَلاَ قُوَّةَ إِلاَّ بِاللَّهِ‏.‏ فَإِنَّهَا كَنْزٌ مِنْ كُنُوزِ الْجَنَّةِ ‏\"‏‏.‏ أَوْ قَالَ أَلاَ أَدُلُّكَ بِهِ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 7386; book 97, hadith 16","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/7386.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":7386,"arabicnumber":7386,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:7386"}},{"day":75,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 075 · At-Takaathur 8","original_text":"ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","translation":"Then, on that day, ye will be asked concerning pleasure.","reference":"Quran 102:8","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/102:8/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6176,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":75,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 075 · الدُّعَاءُ عِنْدَ رُؤْيَةِ بَاكُورَةِ الثَّمَرِ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ بَارِكْ لَنَا فِي ثَمَرِنَا، وبَارِكْ لَنَا فِي مَدِينَتِنَا وبَارِكْ لَنَا فِي صَاعِنَا، وبَارِكْ لَنَا فِي مُدِّنَا","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 77, entry 1: مسلم 2/ 1000","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":77,"chapter_title":"الدُّعَاءُ عِنْدَ رُؤْيَةِ بَاكُورَةِ الثَّمَرِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"مسلم 2/ 1000","repetition_count":1}},{"day":75,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 075 · Bukhari 21 · Belief","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا سُلَيْمَانُ بْنُ حَرْبٍ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا شُعْبَةُ، عَنْ قَتَادَةَ، عَنْ أَنَسٍ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ ثَلاَثٌ مَنْ كُنَّ فِيهِ وَجَدَ حَلاَوَةَ الإِيمَانِ مَنْ كَانَ اللَّهُ وَرَسُولُهُ أَحَبَّ إِلَيْهِ مِمَّا سِوَاهُمَا، وَمَنْ أَحَبَّ عَبْدًا لاَ يُحِبُّهُ إِلاَّ لِلَّهِ، وَمَنْ يَكْرَهُ أَنْ يَعُودَ فِي الْكُفْرِ بَعْدَ إِذْ أَنْقَذَهُ اللَّهُ، كَمَا يَكْرَهُ أَنْ يُلْقَى فِي النَّارِ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 21; book 2, hadith 14","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/21.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":21,"arabicnumber":21,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:21"}},{"day":76,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 076 · Al-Qaari'a 1","original_text":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","translation":"The Calamity!","reference":"Quran 101:1","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/101:1/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6158,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n 