ْتُ الأَتَانَ تَرْتَعُ، فَدَخَلْتُ فِي الصَّفِّ، فَلَمْ يُنْكَرْ ذَلِكَ عَلَىَّ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 76; book 3, hadith 18","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/76.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":76,"arabicnumber":76,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:76"}},{"day":77,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 077 · Al-Qaari'a 2","original_text":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","translation":"What is the Calamity?","reference":"Quran 101:2","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/101:2/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6159,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":77,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 077 · مَا يُقَالُ لِلْكَافِرِ إِذَا عَطَسَ فَحَمِدَ اللَّهَ","original_text":"يَهْدِيكُمْ اللَّهُ وَيُصْلِحُ بَالَكُمْ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 79, entry 1: التّرمذي 5/ 82 وأحمد 4/ 400 وأبو داود 4/ 308، وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 2/ 354","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":79,"chapter_title":"مَا يُقَالُ لِلْكَافِرِ إِذَا عَطَسَ فَحَمِدَ اللَّهَ","entry":1,"source_reference":"التّرمذي 5/ 82 وأحمد 4/ 400 وأبو داود 4/ 308، وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 2/ 354","repetition_count":1}},{"day":77,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 077 · Bukhari 5984 · Good Manners and Form (Al-Adab)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا يَحْيَى بْنُ بُكَيْرٍ، حَدَّثَنَا اللَّيْثُ، عَنْ عُقَيْلٍ، عَنِ ابْنِ شِهَابٍ، أَنَّ مُحَمَّدَ بْنَ جُبَيْرِ بْنِ مُطْعِمٍ، قَالَ إِنَّ جُبَيْرَ بْنَ مُطْعِمٍ أَخْبَرَهُ أَنَّهُ، سَمِعَ النَّبِيَّ صلى الله عليه وسلم يَقُولُ ‏ \"‏ لاَ يَدْخُلُ الْجَنَّةَ قَاطِعٌ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 5984; book 78, hadith 15","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/5984.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":5984,"arabicnumber":5984,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:5984"}},{"day":78,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 078 · Al-Qaari'a 3","original_text":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","translation":"Ah, what will convey unto thee what the Calamity is!","reference":"Quran 101:3","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/101:3/editions/q