":"Sahih al-Bukhari 7389; book 97, hadith 18","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/7389.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":7389,"arabicnumber":7389,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:7389"}},{"day":87,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 087 · Al-Aadiyaat 1","original_text":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلْعَٰدِيَٰتِ ضَبْحًۭا","translation":"By the snorting courses,","reference":"Quran 100:1","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/100:1/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6147,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":87,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 087 · الدُّعَاءُ لِمَنْ قَالَ إِنِّي أُحِبُّكَ فِي اللَّهِ","original_text":"أَحَبَّكَ الذِي أَحْبَبْتَنِي لَهُ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 90, entry 1: أخرجه أبو داود 4/ 333، وحسّنه الألباني في صحيح سنن أبي داود 3/ 965","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":90,"chapter_title":"الدُّعَاءُ لِمَنْ قَالَ إِنِّي أُحِبُّكَ فِي اللَّهِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أخرجه أبو داود 4/ 333، وحسّنه الألباني في صحيح سنن أبي داود 3/ 965","repetition_count":1}},{"day":87,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 087 · Bukhari 24 · Belief","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ يُوسُفَ، قَالَ أَخْبَرَنَا مَالِكُ بْنُ أَنَسٍ، عَنِ ابْنِ شِهَابٍ، عَنْ سَالِمِ بْنِ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ، عَنْ أَبِيهِ، أَنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم مَرَّ عَلَى رَجُلٍ مِنَ الأَنْصَارِ وَهُوَ يَعِظُ أَخَاهُ فِي الْحَيَاءِ، فَقَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏ \"‏ دَعْهُ فَإِنَّ الْحَيَاءَ مِنَ الإِيمَانِ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 24; book 2, hadith 17","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/24.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":24,"arabicnumber":24,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:24"}},{"day":88,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 088 · Al-Aadiyaat 2","original_text":"فَٱلْمُورِيَٰتِ قَدْحًۭا","translation":"Striking sparks of fire","reference":"Quran 100:2","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/100:2/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The 