  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":91,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 091 · الدُّعَاءُ لِمَنْ قَالَ بَارَكَ اللَّهُ فِيكَ","original_text":"وَفِيكَ بَارَكَ اللَّهُ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 94, entry 1: أخرجه ابن السّني ص 138 برقم 278 وانظر الوابل الصّيب لابن القيّم ص 304 تحقيق بشير محمد عيون","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":94,"chapter_title":"الدُّعَاءُ لِمَنْ قَالَ بَارَكَ اللَّهُ فِيكَ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أخرجه ابن السّني ص 138 برقم 278 وانظر الوابل الصّيب لابن القيّم ص 304 تحقيق بشير محمد عيون","repetition_count":1}},{"day":91,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 091 · Bukhari 6428 · To make the Heart Tender (Ar-Riqaq)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنِي مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ بَشَّارٍ، حَدَّثَنَا غُنْدَرٌ، حَدَّثَنَا شُعْبَةُ، قَالَ سَمِعْتُ أَبَا جَمْرَةَ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنِي زَهْدَمُ بْنُ مُضَرِّبٍ، قَالَ سَمِعْتُ عِمْرَانَ بْنَ حُصَيْنٍ ـ رضى الله عنهما ـ عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏\"‏ خَيْرُكُمْ قَرْنِي، ثُمَّ الَّذِينَ يَلُونَهُمْ، ثُمَّ الَّذِينَ يَلُونَهُمْ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ عِمْرَانُ فَمَا أَدْرِي قَالَ النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم بَعْدَ قَوْلِهِ مَرَّتَيْنِ أَوْ ثَلاَثًا ‏\"‏ ثُمَّ يَكُونُ بَعْدَهُمْ قَوْمٌ يَشْهَدُونَ وَلاَ يُسْتَشْهَدُونَ، وَيَخُونُونَ وَلاَ يُؤْتَمَنُونَ، وَيَنْذِرُونَ وَلاَ يَفُونَ وَيَظْهَرُ فِيهِمُ السِّمَنُ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6428; book 81, hadith 17","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6428.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6428,"arabicnumber":6428,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6428"}},{"day":92,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 092 · Al-Aadiyaat 6","original_text":"إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لِرَبِّهِۦ لَكَنُودٌۭ","translation":"Lo! man is an ingrate unto his Lord","reference":"Quran 100:6","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/100:6/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6152,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":92,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 092 · دُعَاءُ كَرَاهِيَّةِ الطِّيرَةِ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ لَا طَيْرَ إِلَّا طَيْرُكَ، وَلَا خَيْرَ إِلَّا خَيْرُكَ، وَلَا إِلَهَ غَيْرُكَ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 95, entry 1: أحمد 2/ 220، وابن السني برقم 292، وصححه الألباني في الأحاديث الصحيحة 3/ 54، رقم 1065، أما الفأل فكان يعجب النّبيّ صلّى اللّه عليه وسلّم ولهذا سمع من رجل كلمة طيّبة فأعجبته فقال: (أخذنا فألك من فيك) أبو داود وأحمد، وصححه الألباني في الصحيحة 2/ 363 عند أبي الشيخ في أخلاق النّبيّ صلّى اللّه عليه وسلّم ص 270","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":95,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ كَرَاهِيَّةِ الطِّيرَةِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أحمد 2/ 220، وابن السني برقم 292، وصححه الألباني في الأحاديث الصحيحة 3/ 54، رقم 1065، أما الفأل فكان يعجب النّبيّ صلّى اللّه عليه وسلّم ولهذا سمع من رجل كلمة طيّبة فأعجبته فقال: (أخذنا فألك من فيك) أبو داود وأحمد، وصححه الألباني في الصحيحة 2/ 363 عند أبي الشيخ في أخلاق النّبيّ صلّى اللّه عليه وسلّم ص 270","repetition_count":1}},{"day":92,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 092 · Bukhari 7391 · Oneness, Uniqueness of Allah (Tawheed)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنِي سَعِيدُ بْنُ سُلَيْمَانَ، عَنِ ابْنِ الْمُبَارَكِ، عَنْ مُوسَى بْنِ عُقْبَةَ، عَنْ سَالِمٍ، عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ، قَالَ أَكْثَرُ مَا كَانَ النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم يَحْلِفُ ‏ \"‏ لاَ وَمُقَلِّبِ الْقُلُوبِ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 7391; book 97, hadith 20","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/7391.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":7391,"arabicnumber":7391,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:7391"}},{"day":93,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 093 · Al-Aadiyaat 7","original_text":"وَإِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ ذَٰلِكَ لَشَهِيدٌۭ","translation":"And lo! he is a witness unto that;","reference":"Quran 100:7","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/100:7/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6153,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":93,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 093 · دُعَاءُ الرُّكُوبِ","original_text":"بِسْمِ اللَّهِ، وَالحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ، {سُبْحَانَ الَّذِي سَخَّرَ لَنَا هَذَا وَمَا كُنَّا لَهُ مُقْرِنِينَ * وَإِنَّا إِلَى رَبِّنَا لَمُنْقَلِبُونَ} الحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ، الحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ، الحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ، اللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ، اللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ، اللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ، سُبْحَانَكَ اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي ظَلَمْتُ نَفْسِي فَاِغْفِرْ لِي، فَإِنَّهُ لَا يَغْفِرُ الذُّنُوبَ إِلَّا أَنْتَ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 96, entry 1: أبو داود 3/ 34 والتّرمذي 5/ 501 وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 3/ 156","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":96,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الرُّكُوبِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"أبو داود 3/ 34 والتّرمذي 5/ 501 وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 3/ 156","repetition_count":1}},{"day":93,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 093 · Bukhari 25 · Belief","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ مُحَمَّدٍ الْمُسْنَدِيُّ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو رَوْحٍ الْحَرَمِيُّ بْنُ عُمَارَةَ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا شُعْبَةُ، عَنْ وَاقِدِ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ، قَالَ سَمِعْتُ أَبِي يُحَدِّثُ، عَنِ ابْنِ عُمَرَ، أَنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ أُمِرْتُ أَنْ أُقَاتِلَ النَّاسَ حَتَّى يَشْهَدُوا أَنْ لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ اللَّهُ وَأَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا رَسُولُ اللَّهِ، وَيُقِيمُوا الصَّلاَةَ، وَيُؤْتُوا الزَّكَاةَ، فَإِذَا فَعَلُوا ذَلِكَ عَصَمُوا مِنِّي دِمَاءَهُمْ وَأَمْوَالَهُمْ إِلاَّ بِحَقِّ الإِسْلاَمِ، وَحِسَابُهُمْ عَلَى اللَّهِ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 25; book 2, hadith 18","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/25.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":25,"arabicnumber":25,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:25"}},{"day":94,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 094 · Al-Aadiyaat 8","original_text":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لِحُبِّ ٱلْخَيْرِ لَشَدِيدٌ","translation":"And lo! in the love of wealth he is violent.","reference":"Quran 100:8","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/100:8/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6154,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":94,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 094 · دُعَاءُ السَّفَرِ","original_text":"اللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ، اللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ، اللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ، {سُبْحَانَ الَّذِي سَخَّرَ لَنَا هَذَا وَمَا كُنَّا لَهُ مُقْرِنِينَ * وَإِنَّا إِلَى رَبِّنَا لَمُنْقَلِبُونَ} اللَّهُمَّ إِنَّا نَسْأَلُكَ فِي سَفَرِنَا هَذَا البِرَّ وَالتَّقْوَى، وَمِنَ العَمَلِ مَا تَرْضَى، اللَّهُمَّ هَوِّنْ عَلَيْنَا سَفَرَنَا هَذَا وَاطْوِ عَنَّا بُعْدَهُ، اللَّهُمَّ أَنْتَ الصَّاحِبُ فِي السَّفَرِ، وَالخَلِيفَةُ فِي الأَهْلِ، اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ وَعْثَاءِ السَّفَرِ، وَكَآبَةِ المَنْظَرِ، وَسُوءِ المُنْقَلَبِ فِي المَالِ وَالأَهْلِ. وَإِذَا رَجَعَ قَالَهُنَّ وَزَادَ فِيهِنَّ: (آيِبُونَ، تَائِبُونَ، عَابِدُونَ، لِرَبِّنَا حَامِدُونَ)","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 97, entry 1: مسلم 2/ 998","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":97,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ السَّفَرِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"مسلم 2/ 998","repetition_count":1}},{"day":94,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 094 · Bukhari 81 · Knowledge","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُسَدَّدٌ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا يَحْيَى، عَنْ شُعْبَةَ، عَنْ قَتَادَةَ، عَنْ أَنَسٍ، قَالَ لأُحَدِّثَنَّكُمْ حَدِيثًا لاَ يُحَدِّثُكُمْ أَحَدٌ بَعْدِي سَمِعْتُ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم يَقُولُ ‏ \"‏ مِنْ أَشْرَاطِ السَّاعَةِ أَنْ يَقِلَّ الْعِلْمُ، وَيَظْهَرَ الْجَهْلُ، وَيَظْهَرَ الزِّنَا، وَتَكْثُرَ النِّسَاءُ وَيَقِلَّ الرِّجَالُ، حَتَّى يَكُونَ لِخَمْسِينَ امْرَأَةً الْقَيِّمُ الْوَاحِدُ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 81; book 3, hadith 23","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/81.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":81,"arabicnumber":81,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:81"}},{"day":95,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 095 · Al-Aadiyaat 9","original_text":"۞ أَفَلَا يَعْلَمُ إِذَا بُعْثِرَ مَا فِى ٱلْقُبُورِ","translation":"Knoweth he not that, when the contents of the graves are poured forth","reference":"Quran 100:9","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/100:9/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6155,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":95,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 095 · دُعَاءُ دُخُولِ القَرْيَةِ أَو البَلْدَةِ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ رَبَّ السَّمَوَاتِ السَّبْعِ وَمَا أَظْلَلْنَ، وَرَبَّ الأَرَضِينِ السَّبْعِ وَمَا أَقْلَلْنَ، وَرَبَّ الشَّيَاطِينِ وَمَا أَضْلَلْنَ، وَرَبَّ الرِّيَاحِ وَمَا ذَرَيْنَ، أَسْأَلُكَ خَيْرَ هَذِهِ القَرْيَةِ وَخَيْرَ أَهْلِهَا، وَخَيْرَ مَا فِيهَا، وَأَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّهَا، وَشَرِّ أَهْلِهَا، وَشَرِّ مَا فِيهَا","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 98, entry 1: الحاكم وصحّحه ووافقه الذّهبي 2/ 100 وابن السّني برقم 524 وحسّنه الحافظ في تخريج الأذكار 5/ 154، قال ابن باز: ورواه النّسائي بإسناد حسن. انظر تحفة الأخيار ص 37","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":98,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ دُخُولِ القَرْيَةِ أَو البَلْدَةِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"الحاكم وصحّحه ووافقه الذّهبي 2/ 100 وابن السّني برقم 524 وحسّنه الحافظ في تخريج الأذكار 5/ 154، قال ابن باز: ورواه النّسائي بإسناد حسن. انظر تحفة الأخيار ص 37","repetition_count":1}},{"day":95,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 095 · Bukhari 5987 · Good Manners and Form (Al-Adab)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنِي بِشْرُ بْنُ مُحَمَّدٍ، أَخْبَرَنَا عَبْدُ اللَّهِ، أَخْبَرَنَا مُعَاوِيَةُ بْنُ أَبِي مُزَرِّدٍ، قَالَ سَمِعْتُ عَمِّي، سَعِيدَ بْنَ يَسَارٍ يُحَدِّثُ عَنْ أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏\"‏ إِنَّ اللَّهَ خَلَقَ الْخَلْقَ حَتَّى إِذَا فَرَغَ مِنْ خَلْقِهِ، قَالَتِ الرَّحِمُ هَذَا مَقَامُ الْعَائِذِ بِكَ مِنَ الْقَطِيعَةِ‏.‏ قَالَ نَعَمْ أَمَا تَرْضَيْنَ أَنْ أَصِلَ مَنْ وَصَلَكِ‏.‏ وَأَقْطَعَ مَنْ قَطَعَكِ‏.‏ قَالَتْ بَلَى يَا رَبِّ‏.‏ قَالَ فَهْوَ لَكِ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏\"‏ فَاقْرَءُوا إِنْ شِئْتُمْ ‏{‏فَهَلْ عَسَيْتُمْ إِنْ تَوَلَّيْتُمْ أَنْ تُفْسِدُوا فِي الأَرْضِ وَتُقَطِّعُوا أَرْحَامَكُمْ‏}‏‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 5987; book 78, hadith 18","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/5987.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":5987,"arabicnumber":5987,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:5987"}},{"day":96,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 096 · Al-Aadiyaat 10","original_text":"وَحُصِّلَ مَا فِى ٱلصُّدُورِ","translation":"And the secrets of the breasts are made known,","reference":"Quran 100:10","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/100:10/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6156,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":96,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 096 · دُعَاءُ دُخُولِ السُّوقِ","original_text":"لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ وَحْدَهُ لَا شَرِيكَ لَهُ، لَهُ المُلْكُ وَلَهُ الحَمْدُ، يُحْيِي وَيُمِيتُ وَهُوَ حَيٌّ لَا يَمُوتُ، بِيَدِهِ الخَيْرُ وَهُوَ عَلَى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 99, entry 1: التّرمذي 5/ 491 والحاكم 1/ 538 وحسّنه الألباني في صحيح ابن ماجة 2/ 21 وفي صحيح التّرمذي 3/ 152","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":99,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ دُخُولِ السُّوقِ","entry":1,"source_reference":"التّرمذي 5/ 491 والحاكم 1/ 538 وحسّنه الألباني في صحيح ابن ماجة 2/ 21 وفي صحيح التّرمذي 3/ 152","repetition_count":1}},{"day":96,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 096 · Bukhari 6328 · Invocations","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا عُثْمَانُ بْنُ أَبِي شَيْبَةَ، حَدَّثَنَا جَرِيرٌ، عَنْ مَنْصُورٍ، عَنْ أَبِي وَائِلٍ، عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ قَالَ كُنَّا نَقُولُ فِي الصَّلاَةِ السَّلاَمُ عَلَى اللَّهِ، السَّلاَمُ عَلَى فُلاَنٍ‏.‏ فَقَالَ لَنَا النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم ذَاتَ يَوْمٍ ‏ \"‏ إِنَّ اللَّهَ هُوَ السَّلاَمُ، فَإِذَا قَعَدَ أَحَدُكُمْ فِي الصَّلاَةِ فَلْيَقُلِ التَّحِيَّاتُ لِلَّهِ إِلَى قَوْلِهِ الصَّالِحِينَ‏.‏ فَإِذَا قَالَهَا أَصَابَ كُلَّ عَبْدٍ لِلَّهِ فِي السَّمَاءِ وَالأَرْضِ صَالِحٍ، أَشْهَدُ أَنْ لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ اللَّهُ، وَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهُ وَرَسُولُهُ‏.‏ ثُمَّ يَتَخَيَّرُ مِنَ الثَّنَاءِ مَا شَاءَ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6328; book 80, hadith 25","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6328.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6328,"arabicnumber":6328,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6328"}},{"day":97,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 097 · Al-Aadiyaat 11","original_text":"إِنَّ رَبَّهُم بِهِمْ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ لَّخَبِيرٌۢ","translation":"On that day will their Lord be perfectly informed concerning them.","reference":"Quran 100:11","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/100:11/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani"