hapter 9, entry 2: التّرمذي 1/ 78 وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 1/ 18","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":9,"chapter_title":"الذِّكْرُ بَعْدَ الفَرَاغِ مِنَ الوُضُوءِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"التّرمذي 1/ 78 وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 1/ 18","repetition_count":1}},{"day":132,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 132 · Bukhari 6338 · Invocations","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُسَدَّدٌ، حَدَّثَنَا إِسْمَاعِيلُ، أَخْبَرَنَا عَبْدُ الْعَزِيزِ، عَنْ أَنَسٍ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ قَالَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏ \"‏ إِذَا دَعَا أَحَدُكُمْ فَلْيَعْزِمِ الْمَسْأَلَةَ، وَلاَ يَقُولَنَّ اللَّهُمَّ إِنْ شِئْتَ فَأَعْطِنِي‏.‏ فَإِنَّهُ لاَ مُسْتَكْرِهَ لَهُ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6338; book 80, hadith 35","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6338.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6338,"arabicnumber":6338,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6338"}},{"day":133,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 133 · Al-Alaq 15","original_text":"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","translation":"Nay, but if he cease not We will seize him by the forelock -","reference":"Quran 96:15","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/96:15/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani",