رَةَ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ قَالَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏ \"‏ تَعِسَ عَبْدُ الدِّينَارِ وَالدِّرْهَمِ وَالْقَطِيفَةِ وَالْخَمِيصَةِ، إِنْ أُعْطِيَ رَضِيَ، وَإِنْ لَمْ يُعْطَ لَمْ يَرْضَ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6435; book 81, hadith 24","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6435.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6435,"arabicnumber":6435,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6435"}},{"day":134,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 134 · Al-Alaq 16","original_text":"نَاصِيَةٍۢ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍۢ","translation":"The lying, sinful forelock -","reference":"Quran 96:16","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/96:16/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6122,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":134,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 134 · دُعَاءُ الذَّهَابِ إِلَى الـمَسْجِدِ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ اجْعَلْ لِي نُورًا فِي قَبْرِي .. وَنُورًا فِي عِظَامِي","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 12, entry 2: التّرمذي برقم 3419، 5/ 483","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":12,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الذَّهَابِ إِلَى الـمَسْجِدِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"التّرمذي برقم 3419، 5/ 483","repetition_count":1}},{"day":134,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 134 · Bukhari 7399 · Oneness, Uniqueness of Allah (Tawheed)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا حَفْصُ بْنُ عُمَرَ، حَدَّثَنَا هِشَامٌ، عَنْ قَتَادَةَ، عَنْ أَنَسٍ، قَالَ ضَحَّى النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم بِكَبْشَيْنِ، يُسَمِّي وَيُكَبِّرُ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 7399; book 97, hadith 28","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/7399.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":7399,"arabicnumber":7399,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:7399"}},{"day":135,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 135 · Al-Alaq 17","original_text":"فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","translation":"Then let him call upon his henchmen!","reference":"Quran 96:17","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/96:17/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6123,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":135,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 135 · دُعَاءُ دُخُولِ الـمَسْجِدِ","original_text":"بِسْمِ اللَّهِ، وَالصَّلَاةُ* وَالسَّلَامُ عَلَى رَسُولِ اللَّهِ** اللَّهُمَّ افْتَحْ لِي أَبْوَابَ رَحْمَتِكَ***","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 13, entry 2: * رواه ابن السني برقم 88 وحسنه الألباني\r\n** أبو داود 1/ 126 وانظر صحيح الجامع 1/ 528\r\n*** رواه مسلم 1/ 494. وفي سنن ابن ماجه من حديث فاطمة رضي الله عنها (اللهم اغفر لي ذنوبي وافتح لي أبواب رحمتك) وصححه الألباني لشواهده، انظر صحيح ابن ماجه 1/ 128 - 129","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":13,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ دُخُولِ الـمَسْجِدِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"* رواه ابن السني برقم 88 وحسنه الألباني\r\n** أبو داود 1/ 126 وانظر صحيح الجامع 1/ 528\r\n*** رواه مسلم 1/ 494. وفي سنن ابن ماجه من حديث فاطمة رضي الله عنها (اللهم اغفر لي ذنوبي وافتح لي أبواب رحمتك) وصححه الألباني لشواهده، انظر صحيح ابن ماجه 1/ 128 - 129","repetition_count":1}},{"day":135,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 135 · Bukhari 33 · Belief","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا سُلَيْمَانُ أَبُو الرَّبِيعِ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا إِسْمَاعِيلُ بْنُ جَعْفَرٍ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا نَافِعُ بْنُ مَالِكِ بْنِ أَبِي عَامِرٍ أَبُو سُهَيْلٍ، عَنْ أَبِيهِ، عَنْ أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ آيَةُ الْمُنَافِقِ ثَلاَثٌ إِذَا حَدَّثَ كَذَبَ، وَإِذَا وَعَدَ أَخْلَفَ، وَإِذَا اؤْتُمِنَ خَانَ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 33; book 2, hadith 26","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/33.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":33,"arabicnumber":33,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:33"}},{"day":136,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 136 · Al-Alaq 18","original_text":"سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","translation":"We will call the guards of hell.","reference":"Quran 96:18","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/96:18/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6124,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":136,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 136 · أَذْكَارُ الأَذَانِ","original_text":"وَأَنَا أَشْهَدُ أَنْ لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ، وَحْدَهُ لَا شَرِيكَ لَهُ، وَأَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهُ وَرَسُولُهُ، رَضِيتُ بِاللَّهِ رَبًّا، وَبِمُحَمَّدٍ رَسُولًا وَبِالإِسْلَامِ دِينًا","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 15, entry 2: مسلم 1/ 290. يقول ذلك عقب تشهد المؤذن (ابن خزيمة 1/ 220)","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":15,"chapter_title":"أَذْكَارُ الأَذَانِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"مسلم 1/ 290. يقول ذلك عقب تشهد المؤذن (ابن خزيمة 1/ 220)","repetition_count":1}},{"day":136,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 136 · Bukhari 92 · Knowledge","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ الْعَلاَءِ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو أُسَامَةَ، عَنْ بُرَيْدٍ، عَنْ أَبِي بُرْدَةَ، عَنْ أَبِي مُوسَى، قَالَ سُئِلَ النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم عَنْ أَشْيَاءَ كَرِهَهَا، فَلَمَّا أُكْثِرَ عَلَيْهِ غَضِبَ، ثُمَّ قَالَ لِلنَّاسِ ‏\"‏ سَلُونِي عَمَّا شِئْتُمْ ‏\"‏‏.‏ قَالَ رَجُلٌ مَنْ أَبِي قَالَ ‏\"‏ أَبُوكَ حُذَافَةُ ‏\"‏‏.‏ فَقَامَ آخَرُ فَقَالَ مَنْ أَبِي يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ فَقَالَ ‏\"‏ أَبُوكَ سَالِمٌ مَوْلَى شَيْبَةَ ‏\"‏‏.‏ فَلَمَّا رَأَى عُمَرُ مَا فِي وَجْهِهِ قَالَ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ، إِنَّا نَتُوبُ إِلَى اللَّهِ عَزَّ وَجَلَّ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 92; book 3, hadith 34","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/92.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":92,"arabicnumber":92,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:92"}},{"day":137,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 137 · Al-Alaq 19","original_text":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩","translation":"Nay, Obey not thou him. But prostrate thyself, and draw near (unto Allah).","reference":"Quran 96:19","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/96:19/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6125,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":137,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 137 · دُعَاءُ الاسْتِفْتَاحِ","original_text":"سُبْحَانَكَ اللَّهُمَّ وَبِحَمْدِكَ، وَتَبَارَكَ اسْمُكَ، وَتَعَالَى جَدُّكْ، وَلَا إِلَهَ غَيْرُكَ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 16, entry 2: أخرجه أصحاب السنن الأربعة وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 1/ 77 وصحيح ابن ماجه 1/ 135","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":16,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الاسْتِفْتَاحِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"أخرجه أصحاب السنن الأربعة وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 1/ 77 وصحيح ابن ماجه 1/ 135","repetition_count":1}},{"day":137,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 137 · Bukhari 5994 · Good Manners and Form (Al-Adab)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُوسَى بْنُ إِسْمَاعِيلَ، حَدَّثَنَا مَهْدِيٌّ، حَدَّثَنَا ابْنُ أَبِي يَعْقُوبَ، عَنِ ابْنِ أَبِي نُعْمٍ، قَالَ كُنْتُ شَاهِدًا لاِبْنِ عُمَرَ وَسَأَلَهُ رَجُلٌ عَنْ دَمِ الْبَعُوضِ‏.‏ فَقَالَ مِمَّنْ أَنْتَ فَقَالَ مِنْ أَهْلِ الْعِرَاقِ‏.‏ قَالَ انْظُرُوا إِلَى هَذَا، يَسْأَلُنِي عَنْ دَمِ الْبَعُوضِ وَقَدْ قَتَلُوا ابْنَ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم وَسَمِعْتُ النَّبِيَّ صلى الله عليه وسلم يَقُولُ ‏ \"‏ هُمَا رَيْحَانَتَاىَ مِنَ الدُّنْيَا ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 5994; book 78, hadith 25","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/5994.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":5994,"arabicnumber":5994,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:5994"}},{"day":138,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 138 · At-Tin 1","original_text":"بِّسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلتِّينِ وَٱلزَّيْتُونِ","translation":"By the fig and the olive,","reference":"Quran 95:1","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/95:1/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6099,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":138,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 138 · دُعَاءُ الرُّكُوعِ","original_text":"سُبْحَانَكَ اللَّهُمَّ رَبَّنَا وَبِحَمْدِكَ، اللَّهُمَّ اغْفِرْ لِي","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 17, entry 2: البخاري 1/ 199 ومسلم 1/ 350","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":17,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الرُّكُوعِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"البخاري 1/ 199 ومسلم 1/ 350","repetition_count":1}},{"day":138,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 138 · Bukhari 6339 · Invocations","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ مَسْلَمَةَ، عَنْ مَالِكٍ، عَنْ أَبِي الزِّنَادِ، عَنِ الأَعْرَجِ، عَنْ أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ أَنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ لاَ يَقُولَنَّ أَحَدُكُمُ اللَّهُمَّ اغْفِرْ لِي، اللَّهُمَّ ارْحَمْنِي، إِنْ شِئْتَ‏.‏ لِيَعْزِمِ الْمَسْأَلَةَ، فَإِنَّهُ لاَ مُكْرِهَ لَهُ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6339; book 80, hadith 36","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6339.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6339,"arabicnumber":6339,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6339"}},{"day":139,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 139 · At-Tin 2","original_text":"وَطُورِ سِينِينَ","translation":"By Mount Sinai,","reference":"Quran 95:2","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/95:2/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6100,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Qu