ح 11/ 173","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":35,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الهَمِّ والحُزْنِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"البخاري 7/ 158، كان رسول اللّه صلّى اللّه عليه وسلّم يُكثِر من هذا الدّعاء. انظر البخاري مع الفتح 11/ 173","repetition_count":1}},{"day":148,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 148 · Bukhari 94 · Knowledge","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدَةُ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدُ الصَّمَدِ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ الْمُثَنَّى، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا ثُمَامَةُ بْنُ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ، عَنْ أَنَسٍ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم أَنَّهُ كَانَ إِذَا سَلَّمَ سَلَّمَ ثَلاَثًا، وَإِذَا تَكَلَّمَ بِكَلِمَةٍ أَعَادَهَا ثَلاَثًا‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 94; book 3, hadith 36","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/94.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":94,"arabicnumber":94,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:94"}},{"day":149,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 149 · Ash-Sharh 4","original_text":"وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ","translation":"And exalted thy fame?","reference":"Quran 94:4","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/94:4/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6094,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Tex