ntaining substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":150,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 150 · دُعَاءُ لِقَاءِ العَدُّوِّ وَذِي السُّلْطَانِ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ أَنْتَ عَضُدِي، وَأَنْتَ نَصِيرِي، بِكَ أَجُولُ، وَبِكَ أَصُولُ، وَبِكَ أُقَاتِلُ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 37, entry 2: أبو داود 3/ 42 والتّرمذي 5/ 572، وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 3/ 183","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":37,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ لِقَاءِ العَدُّوِّ وَذِي السُّلْطَانِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"أبو داود 3/ 42 والتّرمذي 5/ 572، وانظر صحيح التّرمذي 3/ 183","repetition_count":1}},{"day":150,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 150 · Bukhari 6341 · Invocations","original_text":"قَالَ أَبُو عَبْدِ اللَّهِ وَقَالَ الأُوَيْسِيُّ حَدَّثَنِي مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ جَعْفَرٍ، عَنْ يَحْيَى بْنِ سَعِيدٍ، وَشَرِيكٍ، سَمِعَا أَنَسًا، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم رَفَعَ يَدَيْهِ حَتَّى رَأَيْتُ بَيَاضَ إِبْطَيْهِ‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6341; book 80, hadith 38","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6341.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6341,"arabicnumber":6341,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6341"}},{"day":151,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 151 · Ash-Sharh 6","original_text":"إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًۭا","translation":"Lo! with hardship goeth ease;","reference":"Quran 94:6","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/94:6/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6096,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":151,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 151 · دُعَاءُ مَنْ خَافَ ظُلْمَ السُّلْطَانِ","original_text":"اللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ، اللَّهُ أَعَزُّ مِنْ خَلْقِهِ جَمِيعًا، اللَّهُ أَعَزُّ مِمَّا أَخَافُ وَأَحْذَرُ، أَعُوذُ بِاللَّهِ الذِي لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا هُوَ، المُمْسِكِ السَّمَاوَاتِ السَّبْعِ أَنْ يَقَعْنَ عَلَى الأَرْضِ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِهِ، مِنْ شَرِّ عَبْدِكَ فُلَانٍ، وَجُنُودِهِ وَأَتْبَاعِهِ وَأَشْيَاعِهِ، مِنَّ الجِنِّ وَالإِنْسِ، اللَّهُمَّ كُنْ لِي جَارًا مِنْ شَرِّهِمْ، جَلَّ ثَنَاؤُكَ وَعَزَّ جَارُكَ، وَتَبَارَكَ اِسْمُكَ، وَلَا إِلَهَ غَيْرُكَ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 38, entry 2: البخاري في الأدب المفرد برقم 708 وصحّحه الألباني في صحيح الأدب المفرد برقم 546","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":38,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ مَنْ خَافَ ظُلْمَ السُّلْطَانِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"البخاري في الأدب المفرد برقم 708 وصحّحه الألباني في صحيح الأدب المفرد برقم 546","repetition_count":3}},{"day":151,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 151 · Bukhari 6438 · To make the Heart Tender (Ar-Riqaq)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو نُعَيْمٍ، حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدُ الرَّحْمَنِ بْنُ سُلَيْمَانَ بْنِ الْغَسِيلِ، عَنْ عَبَّاسِ بْنِ سَهْلِ بْنِ سَعْدٍ، قَالَ سَمِعْتُ ابْنَ الزُّبَيْرِ، عَلَى الْمِنْبَرِ بِمَكَّةَ فِي خُطْبَتِهِ يَقُولُ يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ إِنَّ النَّبِيَّ صلى الله عليه وسلم كَانَ يَقُولُ ‏ \"‏ لَوْ أَنَّ ابْنَ آدَمَ أُعْطِيَ وَادِيًا مَلأً مِنْ ذَهَبٍ أَحَبَّ إِلَيْهِ ثَانِيًا، وَلَوْ أُعْطِيَ ثَانِيًا أَحَبَّ إِلَيْهِ ثَالِثًا، وَلاَ يَسُدُّ جَوْفَ ابْنِ آدَمَ إِلاَّ التُّرَابُ، وَيَتُوبُ اللَّهُ عَلَى مَنْ تَابَ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 6438; book 81, hadith 27","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/6438.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":6438,"arabicnumber":6438,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:6438"}},{"day":152,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 152 · Ash-Sharh 7","original_text":"فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَٱنصَبْ","translation":"So when thou art relieved, still toil","reference":"Quran 94:7","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/94:7/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uth