updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":158,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 158 · دُعَاءُ الرِّيحِ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ خَيْرَهَا، وَخَيْرَ مَا فِيهَا، وَخَيْرَ مَا أُرْسِلَتْ بِهِ، وَأَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّهَا، وَشَرِّ مَا فِيهَا، وَشَرِّ مَا أُرْسِلَتْ بِهِ","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 62, entry 2: مسلم 2/ 616 والبخاري 4/ 76","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":62,"chapter_title":"دُعَاءُ الرِّيحِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"مسلم 2/ 616 والبخاري 4/ 76","repetition_count":1}},{"day":158,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 158 · Bukhari 7404 · Oneness, Uniqueness of Allah (Tawheed)","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا عَبْدَانُ، عَنْ أَبِي حَمْزَةَ، عَنِ الأَعْمَشِ، عَنْ أَبِي صَالِحٍ، عَنْ أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ لَمَّا خَلَقَ اللَّهُ الْخَلْقَ كَتَبَ فِي كِتَابِهِ ـ هُوَ يَكْتُبُ عَلَى نَفْسِهِ، وَهْوَ وَضْعٌ عِنْدَهُ عَلَى الْعَرْشِ ـ إِنَّ رَحْمَتِي تَغْلِبُ غَضَبِي ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 7404; book 97, hadith 33","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/7404.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":7404,"arabicnumber":7404,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:7404"}},{"day":159,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 159 · Ad-Dhuhaa 6","original_text":"أَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيمًۭا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","translation":"Did He not find thee an orphan and protect (thee)?","reference":"Quran 93:6","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/93:6/