khari 37 · Belief","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا إِسْمَاعِيلُ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنِي مَالِكٌ، عَنِ ابْنِ شِهَابٍ، عَنْ حُمَيْدِ بْنِ عَبْدِ الرَّحْمَنِ، عَنْ أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ، أَنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ مَنْ قَامَ رَمَضَانَ إِيمَانًا وَاحْتِسَابًا غُفِرَ لَهُ مَا تَقَدَّمَ مِنْ ذَنْبِهِ ‏\"‏‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 37; book 2, hadith 30","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/37.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"fawazahmed0/hadith-api, Arabic Sahih al-Bukhari; classical Arabic text","revision":"df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784","dataset_hadithnumber":37,"arabicnumber":37,"canonical_url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:37"}},{"day":160,"kind":"ayah","title":"Day 160 · Ad-Dhuhaa 7","original_text":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآلًّۭا فَهَدَىٰ","translation":"Did He not find thee wandering and direct (thee)?","reference":"Quran 93:7","source_url":"https://api.alquran.cloud/v1/ayah/93:7/editions/quran-uthmani,en.pickthall","translator":"Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (1930), via Al Quran Cloud en.pickthall","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Al Quran Cloud; Arabic Uthmani edition / Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)","arabic_edition":"quran-uthmani","translation_edition":"en.pickthall","global_ayah":6086,"license_notice":"Tanzil Quran Text \n  Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\n  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 \n\n  This copy of the Quran text is carefully produced, highly \n  verified and continuously monitored by a group of specialists \n  in Tanzil Project.\n\n  TERMS OF USE:\n \n  - Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies \n    of this text, but CHANGING IT IS NOT ALLOWED.\n\n  - This Quran text can be used in any website or application, \n    provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, \n    and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep\n    track of changes.\n\n  - This copyright notice shall be included in all verbatim copies \n    of the text, and shall be reproduced appropriately in all files \n    derived from or containing substantial portion of this text.\n\n  Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/"}},{"day":160,"kind":"dua","title":"Day 160 · الدُّعَاءُ عِنْدَ إِفْطَارِ الصَّائِمِ","original_text":"اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ بِرَحْمَتِكَ التِي وَسِعَتْ كُلَّ شَيْءٍ أَنْ تَغْفِرَ لِي","translation":"","reference":"Hisn al-Muslim, chapter 69, entry 2: أخرجه ابن ماجة 1/ 557 من دعاء عبد اللّه بن عمرو رضي اللّه عنهما، وحسّنه الحافظ في تخريج الأذكار انظر شرح الأذكار 4/ 342","source_url":"https://github.com/asellam/HisnElMuslim/blob/872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a/hisn.json","translator":"","grade":"","provenance":{"provider":"Hisn al-Muslim Arabic transcription by Abdellah SELLAM (asellam/HisnElMuslim)","revision":"872764ca013116c905f7fc9c3dc972c27cd37d4a","chapter":69,"chapter_title":"الدُّعَاءُ عِنْدَ إِفْطَارِ الصَّائِمِ","entry":2,"source_reference":"أخرجه ابن ماجة 1/ 557 من دعاء عبد اللّه بن عمرو رضي اللّه عنهما، وحسّنه الحافظ في تخريج الأذكار انظر شرح الأذكار 4/ 342","repetition_count":1}},{"day":160,"kind":"hadith","title":"Day 160 · Bukhari 96 · Knowledge","original_text":"حَدَّثَنَا مُسَدَّدٌ، قَالَ حَدَّثَنَا أَبُو عَوَانَةَ، عَنْ أَبِي بِشْرٍ، عَنْ يُوسُفَ بْنِ مَاهَكَ، عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ عَمْرٍو، قَالَ تَخَلَّفَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم فِي سَفَرٍ سَافَرْنَاهُ فَأَدْرَكَنَا وَقَدْ أَرْهَقْنَا الصَّلاَةَ صَلاَةَ الْعَصْرِ وَنَحْنُ نَتَوَضَّأُ، فَجَعَلْنَا نَمْسَحُ عَلَى أَرْجُلِنَا، فَنَادَى بِأَعْلَى صَوْتِهِ ‏ \"‏ وَيْلٌ لِلأَعْقَابِ مِنَ النَّارِ ‏\"‏‏.‏ مَرَّتَيْنِ أَوْ ثَلاَثًا‏.‏","translation":"","reference":"Sahih al-Bukhari 96; book 3, hadith 38","source_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api/df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/ara-bukhari/96.json","translator":"","grade":"","provena